- **Review Cycles**: 1-2 (simple workflow)
{{else}}
- **Estimated Duration**: {{sprint_count}} sprint{{#if (gt sprint_count 1)}}s{{/if}}{{#if phase_count}} across {{phase_count}} phase{{#if (gt phase_count 1)}}s{{/if}}{{/if}}
- **Commit Frequency**: {{git_checkpoints.length}} checkpoint commit{{#if (gt git_checkpoints.length 1)}}s{{/if}} + incremental commits within sprints
- **Review Cycles**: 2-3 (incremental reviews at phase boundaries)
{{/if}}
- **Performance Budget**: <10% overhead for workflow management
- **Success Criteria**: All quality gates pass, all tasks completed with checkboxes marked

